# ============================================================
# Curis by Citrus ÔÇö .gitignore
# Governed healthcare SaaS repository
# Stack assumption: Laravel/PHP backend + Node/Vite frontend
# Purpose: keep source code versioned while excluding secrets,
# tenant data, PHI, generated health records, billing artifacts,
# audit exports, local infrastructure files, caches, and build output.
# ------------------------------------------------------------
