# 24. Curis-specific rule: commit examples, not live data
# Commit these:
# - .env.example
# - anonymized demo seeders
# - migrations
# - factories
# - tests
# - safe UI assets
# - public documentation
#
# Never commit these:
# - patient records
# - tenant records
# - OTP/session material
# - M-Pesa/API credentials
# - insurance credentials
# - audit exports
# - billing receipts/invoices generated from real use
# - database backups/dumps
# - private deployment keys
# Local Curis source/reference documents - NEVER commit to GitHub
